1
00:00:00,670 --> 00:00:02,052
Right now, without asking
you,

2
00:00:02,052 --> 00:00:03,895
your body is doing about a
dozen things.

3
00:00:03,895 --> 00:00:04,954
Two thousand years ago,

4
00:00:04,954 --> 00:00:07,027
somebody wrote them all
down, twelve of them,

5
00:00:07,027 --> 00:00:08,040
and asked a physician,

6
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,330
who exactly was
responsible.

7
00:00:10,504 --> 00:00:12,425
Let the record show that
this is an inquiry,

8
00:00:12,425 --> 00:00:13,429
and not a consultation.

9
00:00:13,429 --> 00:00:14,869
Twelve counts of
insubordination,

10
00:00:14,869 --> 00:00:16,528
committed inside my own
person, daily,

11
00:00:16,528 --> 00:00:17,837
for as long as I can
remember.

12
00:00:17,837 --> 00:00:19,496
Somebody in here is
answerable for it.

13
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,053
The yawn. The hiccup. The
sneeze.

14
00:00:22,053 --> 00:00:24,523
The sob you cannot stop,
the ear that rings,

15
00:00:24,523 --> 00:00:26,319
the tongue you bite by
accident.

16
00:00:26,319 --> 00:00:27,779
Twelve things a body
does,

17
00:00:27,779 --> 00:00:29,800
and nobody ever ordered
any of them.

18
00:00:30,183 --> 00:00:32,219
Then your inquiry has a
difficulty in it.

19
00:00:32,219 --> 00:00:34,603
You have twelve offences
and no offender at all.

20
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:36,639
Qi moves out at dawn, and
in at midnight,

21
00:00:36,639 --> 00:00:38,030
the way water goes
downhill,

22
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,818
and it is obeying nobody
whatsoever.

23
00:00:40,681 --> 00:00:42,569
That answer holds for ten
of the twelve.

24
00:00:42,569 --> 00:00:44,504
Ten acts with no author
anywhere in them.

25
00:00:44,504 --> 00:00:46,298
Then the chapter reaches
the eleventh,

26
00:00:46,298 --> 00:00:48,187
and does something it has
not done once,

27
00:00:48,187 --> 00:00:49,320
in ten straight answers.

28
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,057
The heart is the ruler of
the five zang and the six

29
00:00:53,057 --> 00:00:55,095
fu. Grief moves it, and
every organ shakes,

30
00:00:55,095 --> 00:00:56,185
and the tears come out.

31
00:00:56,185 --> 00:00:58,080
Suddenly there is
somebody at the wheel,

32
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,360
and it turns out to be you.

33
00:01:00,298 --> 00:01:02,790
One book, two bodies. One
an administration,

34
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:05,623
where every act has an
officer. The other weather.

35
00:01:05,623 --> 00:01:07,096
The Emperor's Inner
Canon.

36
00:01:07,096 --> 00:01:09,703
Lingshu twenty-eight:
Twelve Small Rebellions.

37
00:01:10,619 --> 00:01:12,820
A dramatized adaptation of
a classical philosophical

38
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:13,878
text. Not medical advice.

39
00:01:13,878 --> 00:01:16,122
We present the Inner Canon
as history and philosophy,

40
00:01:16,122 --> 00:01:17,730
and we mark plainly, in
every episode,

41
00:01:17,730 --> 00:01:19,381
where the evidence does
not support it.
